== About me
I am an Assistant Professor at the Hong Kong University of Science and Technology (HKUST). \n
Previously, I was a postdoctoral researcher at Southern University of Science and Technology, hosted by [https://sites.google.com/site/klwuhomepage/ Prof. Kailliang Wu] at the Department of Mathematics. \n
I received my Bachelor degrees in Aerospace Engineering and Mathematics from Tsinghua University in 2016, followed by a Diplôme d'Ingénieur and a PhD from Mines Paris – Université PSL. My PhD supervisors are [https://fr.linkedin.com/in/ehachem/ Prof. Elie Hachem] and [https://jviquerat.github.io/ Jonathan Viquerat].

{{<b>}} Research Interests {{</b>}} \n 
Reliable, efficient, and robust deep-learning methods for computational science and engineering; data-driven flow modeling; multiscale and chaotic dynamics; closure modeling.\n

{{<b>}} Teaching {{</b>}} \n
At HKUST \n
2025 Fall, Instructor, MATH2411 Applied Statistics. \n
At SUSTech \n
2023 Fall, TA, Probability and Statistical Inference. \n
2022 Summer, Instructor, Introduction to Linux, Python, and Machine Learning \n


